### Campaign Endpoints

### Get all campaigns
GET http://localhost:5000/campaigns

### Get campaign by slug
GET http://localhost:5000/campaigns/summer-campaign

### Create new campaign
POST http://localhost:5000/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Campaign",
  "templateId": 1,
  "slug": "new-campaign",
  "language": "en"
}

### Delete campaign
DELETE http://localhost:5000/campaigns/4




### Product Endpoints

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5000/products

### Create new product
POST http://localhost:5000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Product",
  "price": 100,
  "imageUrl": "image.jpg"
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:5000/products/8

### Get product by campaign id
GET http://localhost:5000/products/1

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:5000/products/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 9.99
}


### Section Content Endpoints

### Get all section contents
GET http://localhost:5000/section-contents

### Create new section content
POST http://localhost:5000/section-contents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "Footer",
  "content": {"text":"New footer content"},
  "campaignId": 2
}

### Get section content by campaign id
GET http://localhost:5000/section-contents/1

### Update section content
PUT http://localhost:5000/section-contents/8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {"text":"New footer content"}
}

### Delete section content
DELETE http://localhost:5000/section-contents/4




### Template Endpoints

### Get all templates
GET http://localhost:5000/templates

### Create new template
POST http://localhost:5000/templates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Template",
  "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
  "textColor": "#000000"
}

### Delete template
DELETE http://localhost:5000/templates/4
